---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Giving" path="/giving" description="The causes Joe Neiman supports: Merici's fight against child trafficking, and Angel Flight missions with SkyHope.">
  <h1>Giving</h1>

  <h2>Merici</h2>
  <p>
    Merici is my primary cause. They're dismantling global child trafficking
    through a proven, effective process that includes rehabilitating the victims.
    I've spent real time with the founder, Om, who has dedicated his life to this
    mission. Eliminating this pure evil and giving these children a second chance
    helps lift trauma that would otherwise hold back future generations. Right now
    my role is philanthropy through investment and collaboration.
  </p>

  <h2>SkyHope</h2>
  <p>
    I'm starting to fly Angel Flight missions for SkyHope: using the plane and the
    ratings to get patients and families where they need to be, at no cost to them.
    It's the best reason I've found to file a flight plan.
  </p>

  <div class="wf-note">Wireframe note: Merici description uses Joe's own words. He also mentioned Tony Robbins backs Merici; left off pending his call on name-dropping. Links to both organizations to be added once confirmed.</div>
</BaseLayout>
